2
00:02:46,903 --> 00:02:50,883
保険 言い訳ばら撒いて
Planting insurance and excuses everywhere,

3
00:02:51,343 --> 00:02:55,783
横切った未来ぶれ途方にくれないよう
so the passing future doesn't blur and leave me stranded...

4
00:02:57,943 --> 00:03:05,103
未知数が憧れに絡まったって奪えはしない
Even if unknowns entangle with my longings, they can't be stolen away!

5
00:03:06,123 --> 00:03:08,903
空を創ろう
Let's create the sky!

6
00:03:10,103 --> 00:03:16,023
散らかったパズル組み合わせても足りない
Even combining the scattered puzzle pieces isn't enough,

7
00:03:17,183 --> 00:03:25,563
壁に写した知らない世界の前にあった重い扉開け
Open the heavy door that stood before the unknown world projected on the wall!

8
00:03:26,123 --> 00:03:30,203
忘れてた少年の絵のように
Like a forgotten boy's painting,

9
00:03:31,023 --> 00:03:36,723
温度は高く微熱まじりで夢はなしてしていたい
High in temperature, mixed with a mild fever, I want to keep dreaming!

10
00:03:37,383 --> 00:03:41,203
もう憧憬は描き飽きて
Now, having grown tired of drawing my longings

11
00:03:41,503 --> 00:03:45,003
全部を見るため空いたアトリエ
to see everything, the empty atelier...

12
00:03:45,003 --> 00:03:47,883
空いたアトリエ
The empty atelier...

13
00:03:49,003 --> 00:03:53,403
帰るアトリエ いつかは
The atelier to return to, someday...

14
00:04:01,003 --> 00:04:10,503
想像してかきなぐって塗り替えても外はもっと進んでいた
Even if I imagine, scribble, and repaint, the outside world kept moving forward!

15
00:04:12,383 --> 00:04:19,463
不揃いな景色の中棘が刺さっても走ってみたい
Inside the uneven scenery, even if thorns prick me, I want to try running!

16
00:04:20,103 --> 00:04:30,343
道を創ろう遠くなるほど細く薄れて描けない
Let's create a path! The further away it gets, the thinner and fainter it becomes, unable to be drawn—

17
00:04:31,023 --> 00:04:39,923
イメージをした近い未来ぼやけたら重い扉開け
If the envisioned near future gets blurry, open the heavy door!

18
00:04:40,403 --> 00:04:44,603
その心大胆に染めよう
Let's dye that heart boldly!

19
00:04:45,023 --> 00:04:50,003
いつかの絵さえ霞むくらいの夢生み出したい
I want to create dreams so vivid they blur even the paintings of old!

20
00:04:51,103 --> 00:04:59,008
成果なんてわからないきっとそれでも去ったアトリエ
I don't know about results, but surely even so, the departed atelier...

21
00:05:00,288 --> 00:05:02,168
去ったアトリエ
An atelier left behind...

22
00:05:03,048 --> 00:05:04,728
僕のアトリエ
My own atelier...

23
00:05:05,148 --> 00:05:08,548
いつでも
Always...

24
00:05:17,188 --> 00:05:21,848
どれだけ濡れても擦ったって消えない
No matter how wet I get, rubbing won't make it disappear...

25
00:05:22,188 --> 00:05:27,508
戻せない現実は鮮やか
I can't go back, reality is so vivid.

26
00:05:27,788 --> 00:05:32,908
忘れてた少年の絵のように
Like the painting of a forgotten boy...

27
00:05:33,228 --> 00:05:38,548
温度は高く微熱まじりで夢話していたい
The temperature is high, mixed with a slight fever, I want to keep talking about my dreams.

28
00:05:39,148 --> 00:05:44,928
もう憧憬は描き飽きて全部を見るため
I'm tired of just sketching yearning, to see everything...

29
00:05:45,188 --> 00:05:50,628
空いたアトリエ 空いたアトリエ
An empty atelier, an empty atelier...

30
00:05:50,968 --> 00:05:58,268
帰るアトリエ いつかは
An atelier to return to, someday...

31
00:06:18,968 --> 00:06:31,768
皆さんこんぬいー！ホロライブ3期生の不知火フレアです！今日は私の生誕祭ライブ2024にお越し下さり、皆さんありがとうございます！
Konnuī, everyone! I'm Shiranui Flare from Hololive 3rd Generation! Thank you all so much for coming to my Birthday Live 2024 today!

32
00:06:33,728 --> 00:06:47,348
そんでもって見てください、このステージ！すっごく可愛いでしょう！この日のために、ウエダさんに作ってもらいました！本当にありがとうございます！
And look at this stage! Isn't it super cute? Ueda-san made it specially for this day! Thank you so much!

33
00:06:48,408 --> 00:07:02,008
今日はこのステージでたくさん盛り上がっていくから、一緒にみんなで盛り上がろうね！そして今日はゲストもたくさんいるので、ゲストのみんなともたくさん歌っちゃうよ！
Today we're going to get super hyped on this stage, so let's all get excited together! And since we have lots of guests today, I'm going to sing a lot with all the guests too!

34
00:07:02,508 --> 00:07:08,508
ハッシュタグはこちら！「不知火フレア生誕祭2024」でたくさんポストしてね！
The hashtag is right here! Please post a lot using #ShiranuiFlareBirthday2024!

35
00:07:09,008 --> 00:07:14,348
それでは今日はみんなでたくさん盛り上がっていきましょう！いくぞー！
Well then, let's all get super hyped up today! Here we go!

36
00:07:23,708 --> 00:07:30,348
クドクドシテルコトバッカリ サッパリトシタイ アジワウミライ
Just nagging, wordy things... I want a refreshing-tasting future.

37
00:07:37,948 --> 00:07:44,788
痛んだ小競り合いは 伸び切った舌戦なんか 飽きて匙を投げる そりゃ遠くに
Worn-out bickering and drawn-out verbal battles... I'm tired of it and throw in the towel, far away.

38
00:07:45,088 --> 00:07:52,408
巡り巡ってあなたのために掬う あぁ スプーンにでもなれたらいいなぁ
Going round and round, scooping it up for your sake. Ah, I wish I could even become a spoon.

39
00:07:53,148 --> 00:08:00,108
絵に描いたご馳走じゃないのに フォンから作るソースじゃないのに ちょっとばっかなぜでしょう 垂涎ものね
Even though it's not a picture-drawn feast, even though it's not a sauce made from fond... Why is it a bit much? It's drool-worthy.

40
00:08:00,108 --> 00:08:06,328
色鮮やかなサラダボウルに 好き嫌いも笑って試して 案外好きなってるんじゃん
In a colorful salad bowl, laughing and trying likes and dislikes, you end up liking it more than you'd think.

41
00:08:06,848 --> 00:08:15,968
鈍色の天気の日には 厚い雲を裂いていくような 風を見てみたい 魔法を見てみたい
On dull-weather days, I want to see a wind that tears through thick clouds, I want to see magic.

42
00:08:16,588 --> 00:08:23,868
思いつくだけのレシピを眺めて 振る舞おうぜ何回だって できたての料理を
Glancing at whatever recipes come to mind, let's serve freshly made dishes no matter how many times...

43
00:08:24,088 --> 00:08:30,228
満開の笑みが見られたのなら 創造の手間もどうだっていい
If I can see full blooms of smiles, the trouble of creation doesn't matter at all.

44
00:08:31,028 --> 00:08:38,288
知らない巡り合いは とんでもない未来 分け合えると知るんだ 不揃いな皿でも
An unfamiliar encounter leads to an unimaginable future; we learn we can share it, even on mismatched plates.

45
00:08:38,568 --> 00:08:45,028
運命小さじ一杯 朝まで目一杯 話そう大小ご希望のプランを
A teaspoon of destiny, a full morning of talking about big and small desired plans.

46
00:08:45,348 --> 00:08:47,888
そうやって贅沢な匙を探していこう
That's how we'll keep searching for luxurious spoons.

47
00:08:51,368 --> 00:08:58,508
ぬくもりも まどろみも 今日の催促で飛んでく
Warmth and slumber fly away due to today's urging.

48
00:08:59,028 --> 00:09:06,128
準備するから 連れてって欲しいのさ 朝日が良く見えるあの丘に
I'm getting ready, so I want you to take me to that hill where the morning sun looks so good.

49
00:09:06,528 --> 00:09:13,568
レジャーシートの用意も ブランケットの装備も 全てぱっぱと集めて揃ったよ
With my leisure sheet ready, blanket equipped, I gathered everything up in a flash and it's all here.

50
00:09:13,988 --> 00:09:20,368
思い付きのキャンピングへ 誰でも巻き込み招待
To a spur-of-the-moment camping trip, inviting and dragging anyone along.

51
00:09:20,668 --> 00:09:27,768
おもいっきり期待が 空ぶったとしても 理不尽ばっか襲ってきたって 言いたくなっても
Even if our expectations miss completely, even if unfairness keeps attacking and makes us want to complain...

52
00:09:27,988 --> 00:09:34,908
どうやったってダメな日もあるけど その失敗もスパイスなんだろう
There are days when nothing works out no matter what, but even those failures must be the spices.

53
00:09:35,188 --> 00:09:42,508
初めての料理がどんな苦くても 誇らしく思うんだ 傷テープ貼った手で
No matter how bitter my very first dish is, I'll think of it proudly with my bandaged hand.

54
00:09:42,748 --> 00:09:47,928
やりきった精一杯 後悔しない失敗 明日にはそう思えるのかな
Pushing through with all my might, making mistakes without regrets—will I be able to think that way tomorrow?

55
00:09:55,368 --> 00:10:00,064
マダマダシラナイコトバッカリ
There's still so much I don't know...

56
00:10:00,242 --> 00:10:02,542
ユックリトイコウ マンキツシタイ
Let's take it easy and enjoy to the fullest...

57
00:10:02,992 --> 00:10:06,012
タンジュンニ キタイスル コウキシン
...with simple, expectant curiosity,

58
00:10:06,242 --> 00:10:09,362
タップリト ミタスヨウ
satisfying it to our heart's content.

59
00:10:10,082 --> 00:10:16,862
隣に居たい ささやかな気持ち秘めて 少し怯えている不安な夜は
Hiding the small desire to stay by your side, on nights when I feel a bit frightened and anxious...

60
00:10:17,442 --> 00:10:26,602
弱い心照らしだすような 星を見ていたい 魔法を見てみたい
...I want to look at stars that light up a weak heart, I want to see magic.

61
00:10:28,242 --> 00:10:39,182
思いつくだけのレシピを眺めて 振る舞おうぜ何回だって できたての料理を 満開の笑みが見られたのなら
Gazing at just any recipe that comes to mind, I'll serve up freshly made dishes however many times it takes, if only I can see your full-blossomed smile!

62
00:10:39,862 --> 00:10:46,522
創造の手間もどうだっていい 清濁混ぜ和えたとんでもない世界
No matter the hassle of creation, it's an outrageous world blending clarity and turbidity.

63
00:10:46,522 --> 00:10:52,562
食べ尽くしていくんだ 酸いも甘いも全部 熱いままにいっぱい 大好きをいっぱい
I'm going to devour it all—sour and sweet alike, keeping it piping hot, with all my favorite things!

64
00:10:52,982 --> 00:11:04,022
詰めよう大層ご機嫌なメニューに 運命が小さじ一杯 朝まで目一杯 話そう大小ご希望のプランを
Let's pack them into a grand, cheerful menu: a teaspoon of fate, a whole night's worth of heart, and talk of plans of any size you wish.

65
00:11:04,502 --> 00:11:07,882
そうやって贅沢な匙を探していこう
That's how we'll search for the luxurious spoon.

66
00:11:47,172 --> 00:11:55,892
愚かでいいのだろう 見渡す夢の跡
It's fine to be foolish, looking out over the aftermath of dreams...

67
00:11:56,292 --> 00:12:01,972
さよなら 青き日々よ
...farewell, those blue days.

68
00:12:19,096 --> 00:12:27,856
流れに身を任せ いつか大人になってゆく 少しずつ汚れていくことなの?
Leaving myself to the current, growing up into an adult someday—is this about getting a little stained along the way?

69
00:12:31,096 --> 00:12:42,396
熟した果実だけ 選ばれて ナイフで裂かれて 飲み込まれる前に
Before only the ripe fruit is chosen, split open by a knife, and swallowed...

70
00:12:45,156 --> 00:12:52,396
僕らは目指した Shangri-La 欲望は抑えきれずに 空想にまみれた
We aimed for Shangri-La, unable to hold back our desires, covered in daydreams.

71
00:12:54,896 --> 00:13:04,596
自由を求め続けた 今なら言えるだろう 此処がそう楽園さ
Continuing to seek freedom, if it's now, I can say this is paradise.

72
00:13:05,196 --> 00:13:11,396
さよなら 青き日々よ
Farewell, those blue days.

73
00:13:20,196 --> 00:13:28,476
大切な何かを踏み台にしてまでも 一番高い林檎を掴みたかった
Stepping on something precious as a stepping stone, I wanted to reach the highest apple.

74
00:13:32,896 --> 00:13:41,096
なくしてから気づく 尊いもの 幼い僕らは 的外れだらけさ
Realizing something precious only after losing it—we, still so childish, were full of off-target mistakes.

75
00:13:47,196 --> 00:13:53,696
満ち足りた日々の清濁は 徐々に不安気味になる
The clarity and turbidity of our fulfilled days gradually turn into unease.

76
00:13:54,896 --> 00:14:02,196
傷を負ってでも 羽ばたきたいと願うよ
Even if bearing scars, I wish to spread my wings and take flight.

77
00:14:02,796 --> 00:14:11,496
愚かでいいのだろう 見渡す夢の跡 さよなら 青き日々よ
It's fine to be foolish, looking out over the aftermath of dreams—farewell, those blue days.

78
00:14:40,196 --> 00:14:47,196
輝く空は 無邪気さを装い 全てを知っていた
The shining sky feigned innocence, knowing everything all along.

79
00:15:41,299 --> 00:15:45,439
超えていこう 君と
Let's go beyond, with you...

80
00:16:24,188 --> 00:16:29,548
どこまでも続くような青の季節は
The blue season that seemed to go on forever...

81
00:16:30,388 --> 00:16:34,988
四つ並ぶ眼の前を遮るものは何もない
There's nothing blocking the view before our four lined-up eyes...

82
00:16:37,088 --> 00:16:41,588
アスファルト 蝉時雨を反射して
Reflecting the asphalt and the shower of cicadas,

83
00:16:42,208 --> 00:16:46,928
きみという沈黙が聞こえなくなる
The silence that is you can no longer be heard.

84
00:16:48,008 --> 00:16:54,988
この日々が色褪せる 僕と違うきみの匂いを知ってしまっても
Even if these days fade, and I come to know a scent of you different from mine,

85
00:16:55,308 --> 00:16:59,408
置き忘れてた永遠の底に
At the bottom of the eternity we left behind...

86
00:17:00,028 --> 00:17:02,268
今でも青が棲んでいる
Blue still dwells within us now.

87
00:17:04,988 --> 00:17:07,488
今でも青は澄んでいる
Blue is still clear and pure now.

88
00:17:09,128 --> 00:17:14,468
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに 届かなかった
No matter what prayers or words, though we got close, they wouldn't reach.

89
00:17:18,088 --> 00:17:22,528
頬を伝った夏のような色のなか
Amidst the summer-like colors running down my cheek,

90
00:17:24,088 --> 00:17:26,628
きみを呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる
Words cursing you remain stubbornly stuck deep in my throat.

91
00:17:27,208 --> 00:17:32,488
「また会えるよね」って 声にならない声
“We can meet again, right?”—a voice that cannot become words...

92
00:17:41,788 --> 00:17:46,668
昼下がり じめつく風の季節は
The humid midday breeze of the season...

93
00:17:47,928 --> 00:17:53,248
想い馳せる まだ何者でもなかった僕らの肖像
Yearning for the portraits of us when we were still nobody at all.

94
00:17:55,768 --> 00:18:01,148
何もかも分かち合えたはずだった
We must have shared everything...

95
00:18:01,468 --> 00:18:05,228
あの日から少しずつ きみと違う僕という呪いが肥っていく
Yet since that day, little by little, the curse of being someone different from you has grown.

96
00:18:17,968 --> 00:18:22,988
きみの笑顔の奥の憂いを
The sorrow deep behind your smile...

97
00:18:24,028 --> 00:18:30,008
見落としたこと 悔やみ尽くして
Regretting to the depths for overlooking it...

98
00:18:37,928 --> 00:18:42,488
徒花と咲いて散っていくきみに さよなら
Farewell to you, blooming in vain and scattering away.

99
00:18:45,308 --> 00:18:49,368
今でも青が棲んでいる
Blue still dwells within us now.

100
00:18:49,688 --> 00:18:51,768
今でも青は澄んでいる
Blue is still clear and pure now.

101
00:18:51,988 --> 00:18:57,328
どんな祈りも言葉も 近づけるのに 届かなかった
No matter what prayers or words, though we got close, they wouldn't reach.

102
00:18:58,588 --> 00:19:04,008
頬を伝った夏のような色のなか
Amidst the summer-like colors running down my cheek,

103
00:19:05,368 --> 00:19:07,828
きみを呪う言葉がずっと喉の奥につかえてる
Words cursing you remain stubbornly stuck deep in my throat.

104
00:19:08,088 --> 00:19:13,388
「また会えるよね」って 声にならない声
“We can meet again, right?”—a voice that cannot become words...

105
00:19:17,768 --> 00:19:26,428
無限に膨張する銀河の星の粒のように 指の隙間を零れた
Like grains of stars in an infinitely expanding galaxy, they spilled through the gaps of my fingers.

106
00:19:41,208 --> 00:19:45,388
超えていこう 君と
Let's go beyond, with you...

107
00:19:53,127 --> 00:19:58,287
希望に溢れた未来 押し付けられている
A future overflowing with hope is being forced upon us.

108
00:20:00,259 --> 00:20:05,239
用意された夢たちに 心が動けない
My heart cannot move toward the prepared dreams...

109
00:20:06,199 --> 00:20:11,959
それでも前へと 進めという 想いに導かれて 踏み出した
Yet guided by the desire telling me to push forward, I stepped forth...

110
00:20:11,959 --> 00:20:18,079
その先世界が変わる
...and the world beyond changes.

111
00:20:18,799 --> 00:20:25,879
凍てつく氷を溶かすものは 熱く燃え盛る魂
What melts the freezing ice is a fiercely burning soul.

112
00:20:26,259 --> 00:20:30,279
眠らせていた 未だ見ぬ力呼び起こせ
Awaken the power you kept slumbering, unseen until now!

113
00:20:30,639 --> 00:20:38,959
大丈夫さ 繰り返し呟く 言葉は力を生み出す
"It'll be alright," I repeatedly murmur; these words give birth to strength.

114
00:20:39,319 --> 00:20:43,559
そこからには まだ先がある 突き抜けろ
From there, there's still a way ahead—break on through!

115
00:20:46,259 --> 00:20:51,639
心の全力は 笑顔のため
The full strength of the heart is for a smile.

116
00:20:52,739 --> 00:20:59,979
涙の向こう側を越えてゆける 君と
I can go beyond the tears, with you...

117
00:21:06,019 --> 00:21:11,639
正しさを纏いながら 言葉の群れ達が
Clothed in righteousness, flocks of words...

118
00:21:12,319 --> 00:21:18,019
行き交い傷を広げる 意識のないままに
...cross paths and widen wounds, without even realizing it.

119
00:21:19,019 --> 00:21:24,899
それでもそこに 見えない愛 見つけられたとしたら
Even so, if we manage to find an unseen love there,

120
00:21:25,259 --> 00:21:30,659
一粒の光が世界を変える
a single droplet of light will change the world.

121
00:21:31,559 --> 00:21:38,739
深い愛も一瞬で姿を変えて 恨みの牙を剥く
Even deep love can instantly change its appearance and bare fangs of grudge.

122
00:21:39,259 --> 00:21:43,379
裏切りが産む 彷徨う心を抱きしめて
Embrace the wandering heart born of betrayal.

123
00:21:43,919 --> 00:21:51,659
培った勇気を ささやかな誤解だけで 途中で投げ出さず
Without throwing away the courage we've cultivated over mere trivial misunderstandings...

124
00:21:52,499 --> 00:21:57,019
でも乗り越えて 絆となれば揺るがない
...by overcoming it to become an unshakeable bond!

125
00:21:59,399 --> 00:22:05,039
後悔があるから また歩ける
Because there are regrets, I can walk once more.

126
00:22:05,639 --> 00:22:11,959
雑音切り裂いて 超えてゆこう 君と
Cutting through the noise, let's push past it, with you...

127
00:22:32,619 --> 00:22:39,859
凍てつく氷を溶かすものは 熱く燃え盛る魂
What melts the freezing ice is a fiercely burning soul.

128
00:22:40,219 --> 00:22:44,399
眠らせていた 未だ見ぬ力呼び起こせ
Awaken the power you kept slumbering, unseen until now!

129
00:22:45,159 --> 00:22:52,919
大丈夫さ 繰り返し呟く 言葉は力を生み出す
"It'll be alright," I repeatedly murmur; these words give birth to strength.

130
00:22:53,239 --> 00:22:57,499
そこからには まだ先がある 突き抜けろ
From there, there's still a way ahead—break on through!

131
00:23:00,199 --> 00:23:05,599
心の全力は 笑顔のため
The full strength of the heart is for a smile.

132
00:23:06,439 --> 00:23:13,419
涙の向こう側を越えてゆける 君と
I can go beyond the tears, with you...

133
00:23:40,473 --> 00:23:46,473
じっと日々を見逃さないで きっと大人はそれらしくするのでかかりきりになるんだ
Don't miss the details of each day; adults are too busy acting like grownups.

134
00:23:47,473 --> 00:23:50,473
関心はまだ僕ら 真珠の欠片だって無価値
Our interests are still just worthless fragments of pearls...

135
00:23:50,473 --> 00:23:57,473
そこに物語がなければ からくりの中で廻る僕ら命だ
...if there is no story within them, we are just lives spinning inside a mechanism.

136
00:24:13,813 --> 00:24:18,813
不思議のような毎日を 当たり前に手を差し伸べ合って過ごしている
Living each miraculous day as if it were ordinary, reaching out our hands to one another.

137
00:24:19,593 --> 00:24:24,593
心温かでいることを 笑うほど寂しいことではないでしょ
For the heart to be warm—surely that isn't so lonely it makes you want to laugh, right?

138
00:24:24,813 --> 00:24:29,813
落ち込む夜でさえ冴えて 気まぐれのように
Even on depressing nights, lucidly and whimsically...

139
00:24:30,253 --> 00:24:37,773
どの人生も悪くはないだろう 強がることを知れど 今までの足跡や生まれたことは消えやしない
Every life can't be all bad, right? Though I learned to put up a front, the footprints and birth up to now will never vanish.

140
00:24:38,333 --> 00:24:44,333
軽い冗談で傷がついてしまう 柔らかなままでいい そのままでいい
Getting hurt over a light joke—it's fine to stay soft, just stay as you are.

141
00:24:46,333 --> 00:24:52,333
じっと日々を見逃さないで きっと大人はそれらしくするのでかかりきりになるんだ
Don't miss the details of each day; adults are too busy acting like grownups.

142
00:24:52,533 --> 00:24:59,333
関心はまだ僕ら 真珠の欠片だって無価値、そこに物語がなければ からくりの中で廻る
Our interests are still just worthless fragments of pearls; if there is no story within them, spinning within the mechanism...

143
00:25:00,294 --> 00:25:02,474
からくりの中で廻る僕ら命だ
It's our lives circulating inside the mechanism...

144
00:25:02,814 --> 00:25:05,154
あぁ間違っていないね
Ah, we aren't wrong, are we?

145
00:25:05,474 --> 00:25:10,074
喜劇ばかりじゃここには立っていないってこと
Just playing comedies means we couldn't stand right here.

146
00:25:11,114 --> 00:25:12,874
気晴らしに今ならどこへだって
Wherever we go for a pastime now,

147
00:25:13,374 --> 00:25:15,334
僕ら光のように気が付かない
won't we realize it like light?

148
00:25:15,574 --> 00:25:17,774
間違ってる涙なんてない
There are no wrong tears.

149
00:25:19,114 --> 00:25:23,394
じっと意味を見逃さないで きっと大人はそれらしくするので
Don't miss the subtle meanings, surely adults act the part,

150
00:25:23,614 --> 00:25:26,194
かかりきりになるんだ 関心はまだ僕ら
so they get fully absorbed, our interest is still in us.

151
00:25:26,854 --> 00:25:31,934
真珠の欠片だって無価値、そこに物語がなければ
Even fragments of pearls are worthless if there's no story there.

152
00:25:32,554 --> 00:25:35,554
からくりの中で廻る僕ら命だ
It's our lives circulating inside the mechanism.

153
00:25:52,134 --> 00:25:58,094
じっと意味を見逃さないで きっと大人はそれらしくするので かかりきりになるんだ
Don't miss the subtle meanings, surely adults act the part, so they get fully absorbed,

154
00:25:58,894 --> 00:26:04,114
関心はまだ僕ら 真珠の欠片だって無価値、そこに物語がなければ
our interest is still in us, even fragments of pearls are worthless if there's no story there.

155
00:26:04,694 --> 00:26:07,974
からくりの中で廻る僕らは
inside the mechanism, we are...

156
00:26:08,674 --> 00:26:17,214
鳴り損ないで溢れた 差し絵のような幸せを求めている
seeking happiness like an illustration, overflowing with misfires.

157
00:26:17,634 --> 00:26:22,654
感性は絵の具 混ざり合える この街で当たり前に今
Sensibility is paint that can mingle, naturally shining right now in this city.

158
00:26:23,074 --> 00:26:28,174
輝いている
It is shining.

159
00:27:07,534 --> 00:27:13,494
ねぇ 気付いて 大事な人は誰
Hey, notice it... Who is the most important person?

160
00:27:14,754 --> 00:27:20,234
[Title: 虹が架かるまでの話]
[Title: 作詞: 金丸佳史・作曲: 中野領太]
[Title: Niji ga Kakaru Made no Hanashi]
[Title: Lyrics: Yoshifumi Kanamaru · Music: Ryota Nakano]

161
00:27:21,594 --> 00:27:24,594
青い風が吹いた ふたつ影が並んだ
A blue wind blew, two shadows lined up side by side.

162
00:27:25,114 --> 00:27:28,294
不器用なほどにゆらゆら揺れてた
Swaying, swaying so clumsily.

163
00:27:29,114 --> 00:27:34,334
意識しないことで 自分自身守っては
Protecting ourselves by not being conscious of it,

164
00:27:34,974 --> 00:27:37,934
いつの日か引いたラインを眺めて
gazing at the line drawn someday,

165
00:27:38,434 --> 00:27:47,534
複雑に見せて 単純な恋なのに 答えが書かれたテスト まだ解けないんだ
making it look complicated when it's simple love, a test with answers written, still unable to solve it.

166
00:27:50,147 --> 00:27:57,774
嘘をついて 誤魔化したって 心までは騙せない
Even if we tell lies and gloss over it, we can't fool our hearts.

167
00:27:58,414 --> 00:28:07,574
このままで いいわけないよね 時は止まってくれないよ
There's no way staying like this is fine, time won't stop for us.

168
00:28:08,454 --> 00:28:14,634
素直になって 見つめ合えば 今までの曇り空は青空へ
If we become honest and gaze at each other, until now's cloudy skies turn into a blue sky.

169
00:28:16,974 --> 00:28:26,694
心と心結んだ虹が架かる
A rainbow connecting our hearts bridges across, wrapping around the two of us and shining bright.

170
00:28:40,314 --> 00:28:46,614
何気ないことがそう かけがえないものへ
Everyday trivial things become something irreplaceable,

171
00:28:47,434 --> 00:28:53,534
変わる様にふたりの距離を縮めよう
let's shorten the distance between us so that it changes.

172
00:28:54,374 --> 00:29:00,774
深く深く呼吸して 今日の空見つめて
Breathing deeply, deeply, gazing at today's sky,

173
00:29:01,214 --> 00:29:06,774
流れゆく雲の切れ間を探した
searching for the gaps in the drifting clouds.

174
00:29:07,514 --> 00:29:12,874
友達以上とか 恋人未満だとか
Like "more than friends" or "less than lovers",

175
00:29:13,414 --> 00:29:19,634
誰かが決めたルールを 飛び越えてみようよ
let's try leaping over the rules someone else decided.

176
00:29:20,294 --> 00:29:26,934
意識し合って ありのままで ふたりがもっと近づけば
Acknowledging each other just as we are, if the two of us get even closer,

177
00:29:27,574 --> 00:29:33,454
隠し続けてた鼓動は この空に響いてくよ
the heartbeat we kept hiding will echo into this sky.

178
00:29:34,174 --> 00:29:41,374
戸惑いだって 切なさだってそのすべてがきっと大切なもの
Hesitation, sadness, all of those are surely precious things.

179
00:29:42,214 --> 00:29:47,694
ふたりに見えない 形のない想いを
Unseen, formless feelings between the two of us,

180
00:29:48,147 --> 00:29:54,254
手繰り寄せればきっと引き合うよ
if we reel them in, surely we'll pull each other close.

181
00:30:06,340 --> 00:30:08,710
当たり前の帰り道
The usual way home,

182
00:30:09,020 --> 00:30:12,490
当たり前の連絡も
And the usual messages,

183
00:30:13,540 --> 00:30:18,340
突然なくなるかもしれない
Might suddenly disappear...

184
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:24,970
そっと心に手を当て聞けばいい
Just gently place a hand on your heart and listen,

185
00:30:26,220 --> 00:30:32,510
きっと答えはひとつだから
And surely the answer is one, so...

186
00:30:37,140 --> 00:30:43,510
ねぇ、気付いて大事な人は誰
Hey, notice who the precious person is.

187
00:30:44,390 --> 00:30:50,640
嘘をついて 誤魔化したって 心までは騙せない
Even if you lie and brush it aside, you can't fool your heart.

188
00:30:51,340 --> 00:31:05,340
眩しすぎるその光の中にふたりが見えるよ 素直になって 見つめ合えば 今までの曇り空は青空へ
I can see the two of us inside that dazzling light; if we become honest and gaze at each other, the cloudy skies until now turn into a blue sky.

189
00:31:06,520 --> 00:31:11,640
心と心結んだ虹が架かる
A rainbow connecting our hearts will span across.

190
00:31:12,040 --> 00:31:17,340
ふたりを包み込んで 輝くよ
Wrapping us both in its shine.

191
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:24,340
輝くよ
Shining bright...

192
00:32:54,988 --> 00:32:59,188
[Title: 春泥棒]

193
00:32:55,388 --> 00:32:59,188
[Text: 作詞作曲:n-buna]
[Text: Lyrics & Music: n-buna]

194
00:33:07,314 --> 00:33:13,764
高架橋を抜けたら 雲の隙間に青が覗いた
Passing through the overpass, blue peeked through a gap in the clouds.

195
00:33:14,404 --> 00:33:20,764
最近どうも暑いから ただ風が吹くのを待ってた
Lately it's been rather hot, so I was just waiting for the wind to blow.

196
00:33:22,444 --> 00:33:29,104
木陰に座る 何か頬に付く 見上げれば頭上に咲いて散る
Sitting in the shade of a tree, something brushes my cheek; looking up to see them blooming and scattering overhead.

197
00:33:37,144 --> 00:33:45,584
はらり、僕らもう息も忘れて 瞬きさえ億劫
Softly, we already forget to breathe, finding even blinking too much trouble.

198
00:33:45,584 --> 00:33:51,684
さぁ、今日さえ明日過去に変わる ただ風を待つ
Come now, even today turns into tomorrow's past, as we just wait for the wind.

199
00:33:52,524 --> 00:34:00,164
だから僕らもう声も忘れて さよならさえ億劫
So we already forget our voices, finding even goodbyes a bother.

200
00:34:00,864 --> 00:34:03,684
ただ花が降るだけ
As flowers simply fall down.

201
00:34:04,324 --> 00:34:07,584
晴れり 今、春吹雪
It clears up, now a spring snowstorm.

202
00:34:24,224 --> 00:34:30,524
次の日も待ち合わせ 花見の客も少なくなった
Meeting up again the next day, the cherry blossom viewers had grown fewer.

203
00:34:31,484 --> 00:34:38,484
春の匂いはもう止む 今年も夏が来るのか
The scent of spring is already fading; will summer arrive again this year too?

204
00:34:39,304 --> 00:34:46,664
高架橋を抜けたら 道の先に君が覗いた
Passing through the overpass, you peeked out ahead on the path.

205
00:34:47,304 --> 00:34:53,524
残りはどれだけかな どれだけ春に会えるだろう
How much time is left, I wonder? How many more springs will I get to see you?

206
00:34:54,704 --> 00:34:59,188
川沿いの丘 木陰に座る
Sitting in the shade on the hill along the river.

207
00:35:02,027 --> 00:35:06,267
また昨日と変わらず今日も咲く
Yet today, just like yesterday, they bloom

208
00:35:09,507 --> 00:35:12,947
花に、僕らもう息も忘れて
Amidst the flowers, we even forget to breathe

209
00:35:13,147 --> 00:35:16,987
瞬きさえ億劫
Reluctant even to blink

210
00:35:17,667 --> 00:35:20,667
花散らせ今吹くこの嵐は
Scattering the blossoms, this storm blowing right now

211
00:35:21,167 --> 00:35:24,627
まさに春泥棒
Is truly a spring thief

212
00:35:25,487 --> 00:35:28,667
風に今日ももう時が流れて
With the wind, time flows on today too

213
00:35:29,147 --> 00:35:31,947
立つことさえ億劫
Reluctant even to stand

214
00:35:32,607 --> 00:35:35,687
花の隙間に空、
Sky in the gaps of the flowers,

215
00:35:36,547 --> 00:35:40,187
散れり、まだ春吹雪
Scattering, still a spring blizzard

216
00:35:56,047 --> 00:35:58,507
今日も会いに行く
Going to meet you today too

217
00:36:00,167 --> 00:36:02,187
木陰に座る
Sitting in the shade of a tree

218
00:36:04,147 --> 00:36:05,707
溜息を吐く
Letting out a sigh

219
00:36:07,327 --> 00:36:10,347
花ももう終わる
The flowers are almost done

220
00:36:11,387 --> 00:36:14,167
明日も会いに行く
Going to meet you tomorrow too

221
00:36:15,147 --> 00:36:18,087
春がもう終わる
Spring is almost over

222
00:36:19,207 --> 00:36:24,167
名残るように時間が散っていく
Time scatters as if lingering behind

223
00:36:27,367 --> 00:36:30,507
愛を歌えば言葉足らず
If I sing of love, words fall short

224
00:36:30,747 --> 00:36:33,627
踏む韻さえ億劫
Reluctant even to rhyme

225
00:36:34,387 --> 00:36:37,687
花開いた今を言葉如きが
The present where flowers bloomed, something mere words

226
00:36:38,087 --> 00:36:40,647
語れるものか
Could ever truly describe?

227
00:36:41,447 --> 00:36:44,947
はらり、僕らもう声も忘れて、瞬きさえ億劫
Scattering, we even forget our voices, reluctant even to blink

228
00:36:49,687 --> 00:36:52,667
花見は僕らだけ
Flower viewing is just for us alone

229
00:36:53,247 --> 00:36:56,327
散るな、まだ春吹雪
Don't scatter yet, spring blizzard

230
00:36:57,207 --> 00:37:04,147
あともう少しだけ もう数えられるだけ
Just a little longer, just enough to count them

231
00:37:12,907 --> 00:37:16,347
あと花二つだけ
Just two more flowers

232
00:37:20,667 --> 00:37:23,707
もう花一つだけ
Just one more flower

233
00:37:27,987 --> 00:37:30,707
ただ葉が残るだけ
Only leaves remain

234
00:37:31,707 --> 00:37:35,587
はらり、今、春仕舞い
Scattering now, closing out spring

235
00:37:52,192 --> 00:37:57,452
[Title: 花の塔]
[Title: Tower of Flowers]

236
00:38:02,592 --> 00:38:07,952
君が持ってきた漫画 くれた知らない名前のお花
The manga you brought, the flower with the unknown name you gave me

237
00:38:08,752 --> 00:38:14,552
今日はまだ来ないかな？ 初めての感情知ってしまった
You aren't coming yet today, are you? I've come to know a brand-new emotion

238
00:38:14,852 --> 00:38:20,612
窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Tracing the painting decorated by the window, journeying through the universe alone

239
00:38:20,612 --> 00:38:24,652
それだけでいいはずだったのに
It should have been fine with just that, but

240
00:38:27,132 --> 00:38:30,632
君の手を握ってしまったら
Once I took your hand in mine,

241
00:38:31,992 --> 00:38:37,692
孤独を知らないこの街には もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
I suppose I can never return to this city that knows no loneliness again

242
00:38:39,312 --> 00:38:43,992
分かっていたのに
Even though I knew it all along

243
00:38:49,672 --> 00:38:54,272
君が手を差し伸べた 光で影が生まれる
Shadows are born from the light where you reached out your hand

244
00:39:00,272 --> 00:39:05,672
歌って聞かせて この話の続き
Sing and let me hear the rest of this story

245
00:39:05,672 --> 00:39:12,946
連れて行って見たことない星まで
Taking me all the way to stars I've never seen before

246
00:40:00,524 --> 00:40:07,324
それはどれだけ素敵なことでしょう
How wonderful that would be...

247
00:40:08,584 --> 00:40:13,544
出したことないほど大きな声で
In a voice louder than I've ever used before

248
00:40:14,484 --> 00:40:19,664
やっと君に伝わる
Finally reaching you

249
00:40:20,184 --> 00:40:25,244
歪なくらいがさ きっとちょうどいいね
A bit of distortion is just right, I'm sure

250
00:40:25,884 --> 00:40:32,344
世界の端と端を結んで
Connecting the ends of the world

251
00:40:43,344 --> 00:40:52,944
窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して それだけでも不自由ないけど
Tracing the paintings decorated on the window and traveling through space alone, even just that wouldn't be inconvenient, but...

252
00:40:54,544 --> 00:41:00,244
僕は選んでみたいの 高鳴る心 謎だらけの空を
I want to choose a sky full of mysteries with a throbbing heart

253
00:41:00,244 --> 00:41:08,024
安全なループを今 書き換えて！
Rewrite the safe loop right now!

254
00:41:09,324 --> 00:41:13,924
君の手を握ってしまったら
If I happen to take your hand...

255
00:41:14,204 --> 00:41:21,244
孤独を知らないこの街には もう二度と帰ってくることはできないの
I can never return to this town that knows no loneliness...

256
00:41:26,044 --> 00:41:30,424
のでしょう
...I suppose I won't be able to return.

257
00:41:31,624 --> 00:41:37,244
いくらでも迷いながら 光も影も見に行こう
Let's go see both light and shadow while getting lost as much as we want

258
00:41:43,244 --> 00:41:52,744
歌って聞かせて この話の続き 連れて行って見たことない星まで
Sing and let me hear the continuation of this story, take me to a star I've never seen before

259
00:42:00,244 --> 00:42:06,924
世界の端と端を結んで
Connecting the ends of the world

260
00:42:42,004 --> 00:42:51,404
It's only love It's only love

261
00:42:52,204 --> 00:42:57,204
[Title: Beautiful World]

262
00:42:58,404 --> 00:43:04,404
もしも願い一つだけ叶うなら
If only one wish could come true

263
